<title>PORTUGAL: Yield falls on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield falls on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of three-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: 23 Mar 99</p>
<p>    COUPON: 8.50 pct   AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 7.5291</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER: 17.85 bln esc</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 7.55 pct</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 224.27 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
